  "summary": "Cornell University announced it ended its contract with Flock Safety on Oct. 14, 2026, and has asked that its seven campus-entry Flock cameras be removed. Cornell is the last of five Tompkins County-area Flock contract holders to end its relationship with the company following student and activist pressure.",
  "key_quotes": [
